in dollar assets,' the PBOC said.  \par \par \uc2 The monetary report didn't immediately have any effect on the market. One state-owned bank trader said commercial banks won't want to conduct \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps if the swap rate is as high as it was last time, which was CNY7.85/dollar.  \par \par \uc2 - -   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020060221e22l007hm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
