* Change in percentage point(s).  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Please double-click on <CNFIXINDEX> for a full list of Chinese fixed-income reference rates.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 OPEN MARKET ACTIVITY  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will issue up to 43.2 billion yuan ($5.34 billion) in bills on Thursday, down from 65 billion yuan a week ago after weeks of strong open market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have pushed up yields of the its bills and repos.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MARKET NEWS  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ** China's yuan weakens on dollar's strength  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SHANGHAI - China's yuan <CNY=CFXS> weakened against the dollar on Thursday as the greenback firmed on the global markets, with no obvious sign of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , dealers said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [ID:nSHA82085]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ** \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  c.bank fails to sell all bills at auction  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SHANGHAI - China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  failed on Thursday to sell all its planned bills for the first time since September 2004, despite a sharp rise in yields, in part because banks are anticipating a further rise, dealers said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [ID:nPEK219761]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - -  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 POLICY NEWS  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ** WHO warns of further China bird flu outbreaks  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BEIJING - China is likely to suffer more outbreaks of bird flu among poultry and possibly people in coming winter months, a WHO official said on Thursday after China confirmed its first cases of human infection.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [ID:nPEK248250]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - -  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ECONOMY NEWS  \f28 \par \