\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-China's yuan weakens vs dlr, tracks global markets  \b0\par\par\uc2 494 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 2005\par 10:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, dealers' comments)  \par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI, Sept 26 (Reuters) - China's yuan <CNY=CFXS> weakened to close at 8.0929 per dollar on Monday, taking its cue from dollar firmness on international markets as dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The yuan, which was revalued by 2.1 percent on July 21 to 8.11, is now a further 0.21 percent stronger.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar hit a two-month high against the euro on Monday after Hurricane Rita caused less damage than feared, driving oil prices lower and reinforcing expectations that the U.S. Federal Reserve would keep raising interest rates.  \par \par \uc2 "It suited the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aim of keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable," said a dealer at Bank of China, the country's top \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  lender.  \par \par \uc2 "Generally speaking, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been much less active on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since the revaluation, but it still won't tolerate the yuan rising too quickly."  \par \par \uc2 Still, in a sign of increasing flexibility, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it would allow the daily trading band between the yuan and non-dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- the euro, yen and Hong Kong dollar -- to widen to 3 percent from 1.5 percent.  \par \par \uc2 The yuan firmed 0.8 percent to close at 9.7411 against the euro on Monday versus Friday's 9.8204, and strengthened 0.5 percent to end at 7.1966 against 100 Japanese yen from 7.2347, according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.pbc.gov.cn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.pbc.gov.cn }}}\uc2 ).  \par \par \uc2 Dealers stuck to a forecast that the yuan would appreciate steadily in the longer run, and could hit 8.0700 per dollar in six to eight weeks -- doubling the amount of appreciation seen since the revaluation.  \par \par \uc2 "That's because of strong dollar supply on the market and increased tolerance on the part of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a Shanghai-based dealer at a foreign bank.  \par \par \uc2 China's swelling trade surpluses have sparked heavy inflows of dollars into the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been the single biggest dollar buyer for more than two years, helping stabilise the yuan when it faced upward pressure.  \par \par \uc2 But dealers said slowing growth in \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves pointed to less \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the revaluation.  \par \par \uc2 The country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves had risen by more than $10 billion in August, Zheng Xinli, deputy head of the party's Central Policy Research Office, said last week.  \par \par \uc2 That compared with a jump of $29 billion in July to more than $740 billion, the world's largest stockpile after Japan's, Tang Xu, head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's research bureau, said on Sept. 16.  \par \par \uc2 One-year onshore forwards were quoted at 7.8410 to the dollar on Monday, anticipating a 3.1 percent appreciation for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in one-year's time.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHINA-YUAN (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|Z|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050926e19q000mu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
