f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  says yuan change not a one-off move  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BEIJING - China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  chief has pointed the way to a stronger yuan by reaffirming that recent reforms to the country's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  regime are more than a one-off change.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [nL29293560]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - -  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ** Emerging Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -Weaker on oil, one-off yuan move downplayed  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE - Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakened on Monday after China ruled out late on Friday another one-off revaluation of its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , dampening expectations for a sharp rise in the yuan ahead of President Hu Jintao's U.S. visit.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [nSP29727]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - -  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 OPEN MARKET ACTIVITY  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will issue up to 20 billion yuan ($2.47 billion) in one-year bills in open market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Tuesday, up from 15 billlion a week ago.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 POLICY NEWS  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ** China should speed up interest rate reform  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BEIJING - China should speed up interest rate reform to complement its new exchange rate regime, a top government economist said in remarks published on Monday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [nPEK204588]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - -  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ECONOMIC NEWS  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ** Profits lag revenue growth for China listed firms  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SHANGHAI - China's publicly listed companies reported strong revenue growth in the first half of the year, but profits rose more slowly as firms struggled with rising costs, state media reported on Monday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Full story: [nSHA284018]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - -  \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHINA-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|Table|Z|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050829e18t000ib\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
