yuan priced into offshore forward markets has shrunk because of trades betting on a convergence between the offshore and the newly expanded onshore forward market in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 Full story: [nSP211193]  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 OPEN MARKET ACTIVITY  \par \par \uc2 - China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  mopped up 5 billion yuan ($3.09 billion) from the banking system on Tuesday, a small amount unchanged from a week ago, while the yield on its one-year bills hit a record low for the sixth straight week.  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 POLICY NEWS  \par \par \uc2 ** China kicks off \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  forwards, yuan strength seen  \par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI - China has kicked off trade in onshore \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  forwards and on Tuesday began broadcasting live quotes from its biggest banks, signalling domestic expectations for how much the yuan might appreciate in up to a year's time.  \par \par \uc2 Full story: [nSHA245823]  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMIC NEWS  \par \par \uc2 ** China July investment higher than expected  \par \par \uc2 BEIJING - Chinese fixed-asset investment grew at a faster-than-expected annual pace in July but still fell from the previous month, reflecting the impact of government curbs and shrinking corporate profit margins.  \par \par \uc2 Full story: [nPEK229380]  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHINA-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|Table|Z|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050816e18g000nc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
