ast month's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  revaluation.  \par \par \uc2 Full story [nPEK234149]  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMIC NEWS  \par \par \uc2 * China Jan-July FDI down 3.4 pct on year ago  \par \par \uc2 BEIJING - Foreign direct investment in China totalled $33.1 billion in the first seven months of the year, down 3.4 percent from a year earlier, official data showed on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Full story: [nBJA000027]  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 * China has yet to tame property sector -think-tank  \par \par \uc2 BEIJING - China has yet to bring the heated property sector under control despite slowing housing inflation, a top government think-tank was quoted on Monday as saying.  \par \par \uc2 Full story [nPEK182900]  \par \par \uc2 - - - -  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHINA-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|Table|Z|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050815e18f000mx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
